------------------------------------------------------------
License
------------------------------------------------------------
The SHDOM distribution does not include an explicit LICENSE file. The
upstream README describes the code as freely distributed via web/ftp.

Per user direction on 2026-04-16, we proceed on the working assumption
of permissive license terms. If the actual terms turn out to be more
restrictive (e.g. research-only, non-redistributable), the subtree
distribution policy needs to be revisited. Original attribution
(Frank Evans, CU Boulder) is preserved here, in README.upstream, and
in every file header.

------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored subset (compiled into libshdom.a)
------------------------------------------------------------
   shdomsub1.f          core solver (spherical harmonic / discrete ordinate)
   shdomsub2.f          pre- and post-solution support subroutines
   shdomsub3.f          I/O subroutines
   fftpack.f            FFT routines used by the angular transform
   ocean_brdf.f         ocean surface BRDF routines
   shdom_mpi.f90        MPI parallelism (already uses include 'mpif.h')
   shdom_nonetcdf.f90   dummy netCDF stubs — MPAS handles its own I/O,
                        so SHDOM's native netCDF path is not needed

