------------------------------------------------------------
Omitted from the upstream distribution
------------------------------------------------------------
   shdom.f90            Upstream main program. Replaced by MPAS's
                        mpas_atmphys_shdom_interface.F wrapper, which
                        invokes SHDOM subroutines directly. The
                        SHDOM_PROPERTY_ARRAYS module defined there is
                        only referenced by PROGRAM SHDOM and is not
                        needed by shdomsub*.f (verified by grep).
   shdom_nompi.f        Unused — we build with MPI.
   shdom_netcdf.f90     Unused — the non-netCDF stub is used instead.
   makefile             Replaced by physics_shdom/Makefile.
   Property-generation
   utilities:           propgen, make_mie_table, miewig, indexwatice,
                        make_tmatrix_table, tmatrixwig, lpd, tmd.par.f,
                        plotscattab, AsciiPropertyFileToNetcdf. MPAS
                        feeds optical properties from RRTMG, not from
                        SHDOM's property generator. These may be added
                        in a later phase if alternative optical-property
                        pipelines become useful.
   Run scripts:         run_brdf, run_mono_les, run_multproc,
                        run_polarized, run_visualize, put.c. Not
                        relevant to MPAS integration.
   Example data:        *.lwc files, lesw16.nml.
   IDL tools:           idl/ subdirectory. MPAS uses Python/matplotlib
                        for visualization.

